# QDS Threat Detection Frontend Environment Variables
#
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/api/v1
NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL=ws://localhost:8000/ws/stream
#
# VERCEL PRODUCTION (set these in Vercel dashboard > Settings > Environment Variables):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=/api/v1
# NEXT_PUBLIC_WS_URL=wss://<your-vercel-domain>/ws/stream
#
# Explanation: Vercel's vercel.json rewrites /api/v1/* to the backend service,
# so the frontend can use a relative path /api/v1 in production.
